          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नफा — naphā — \"profit\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "या वर्षी दुकानाला चांगला नफा झाला. yā varṣī dukānālā cāṅglā naphā jhālā. The shop made a good profit this year."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its opposite is तोटा: नफा (naphā) होणे, तोटा होणे."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नफा (naphā) is a loan from Persian nafʿ, \"gain\", usually traced to Arabic nafʿ, \"benefit\"."
