              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गुंतवणे (guntavṇe) is built on गुंतणे, \"to get tied up\", as its causative; CDIAL sets गुंतणे under Sanskrit gupháti, \"strings together\" (CDIAL 4205): invested money is tied up in a business."
            }
